{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_005_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f317a4313c8391be3ec272b19453fb539e31117b2ebbfd6b86b02c7ab13dfd03",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8691ad273d6bd139e55af6013ee31565e74b02cb45120b48a41168ae171cd3f",
      "text": "主治医生的见解",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23baca96fd950d5a32557155dff81f316bffe493a1bc80f0ff1609865dcb1e68",
      "text": "节假日加班的制作人，\n在事务所遇到了同样休假的薰。\n薰说他是来拿活动剧本的。\n正在交谈时，熬夜工作的制作人\n感到一阵轻微眩晕……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000013:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000013:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8691ad273d6bd139e55af6013ee31565e74b02cb45120b48a41168ae171cd3f",
      "text": "主治医生的见解",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92e0af274eb608d0a99a8d99e6207c8efb428a27e51b1aacae71c546871b81fa",
      "text": "……早上好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80def97ad30845c0cf3da3bad144db3c6f864e0923d47f3d8c1ce114dc7ed109",
      "text": "啊，薰先生。\n早上好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:488d1383b58addebb13fa81b9d641e7bfbdbf0db14c668bb1b4340ca129d2703",
      "text": "怎么了吗？\n薰先生今天应该休息才对……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9465cc7993b1771f86d6e1e19f4cdff6339fcca373f9787082ab95d77a8ef78f",
      "text": "我只是来拿活动剧本的。\n你之前不是说今天早上会送达吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9dbb2e1044cdee1d858476a017aa6dddfb1ee121e0756087a3d2e97834d9f59",
      "text": "是这样的。\n已经送到了，请拿好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df7863eb9d44e5e75276249a08877245deb44db0687a928c92a9456fae231428",
      "text": "倒是你，为什么在事务所？\n今天你应该也是休息才对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77b48a6940a542c939bb380fcad5e5a054d8627a2fb3250d27b056ec60f13219",
      "text": "因为有几项工作想在\n本周内处理完。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9adf8e52b1269e9ae6ed2cac25dd7f1c3a0f08ee0e5e5d627b04573304a459e",
      "text": "真是的……\n最近加班是不是已经成常态了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05b515214cf47b6993ad1d70df861d6a321f10ba1cb2474098a5b4bb40dd1884",
      "text": "健康管理也是工作的一部分。\n要是你倒下了，困扰的人可是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41a8cb844cc7abd1c6fb3cf4f7aef3abc17361be89fe9624d04ba515bcbdfd09",
      "text": "（……哎、奇怪？头晕……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1db7ffac11500c3df668e1d027c4f7498a4d008c8899e4ea16cd6e0019ce007",
      "text": "……！\n喂！●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
